 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "names is a list of full names, each two or more words of ASCII letters separated by single spaces; the first word is the given name and the last the family name. The base of a name is the lowercase first letter of the given name followed by the lowercase family name, truncated to 8 characters. Process names in order: a name gets its base when no earlier name received that username; otherwise it gets, for the smallest k = 1, 2, ... whose result is unused so far, the base truncated to 8 - (number of digits of k) characters followed by the decimal k. Return the usernames in input order.",
